OL,3,GNEWSAParkinson's film 'gently ribs
OL,4,Amonster of an illness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-creator of the Vicar of Dibley
OL,7,Fhas jokingly thanked his 2011
OL,8,FParkinson's diagnosis for providing the
OL,9,Fsubject matter for his first-ever
OL,10,Ffeature film.
OL,12,FOnwards and Sideways was written by
OL,13,FPaul Mayhew-Archer and is based on his
OL,14,Fexperiences of living with the
OL,15,Fdebilitating disease for the past 15
OL,16,Fyears.
OL,18,FIt follows Emma, played by Laura
OL,19,FLinney, and Rhys Ifans's Tony as they
OL,20,Fnavigate the five years after they are
OL,21,Fdiagnosed with Parkinson's on the same
OL,22,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
