OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAParkinson's film 'gently ribs
OL,4,Amonster of an illness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayhew-Archer, who lives in
OL,7,FOxfordshire, said ahead of its release
OL,8,Fon Friday he had "always wanted to
OL,9,Fwrite a film" but "never had a subject
OL,10,Funtil I got Parkinson's".
